1
00:00:03,833 --> 00:00:05,291
Oh Severin, have
you lost your mind?

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:06,916
You’re just a miner, remember?

3
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:12,041
That’s enough.

4
00:00:13,208 --> 00:00:14,083
Back to business.

5
00:00:14,666 --> 00:00:15,416
Time to vote.

6
00:00:15,708 --> 00:00:18,000
All those in favor of
Severin as heir to House Carter,

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:18,958
raise your hands.

8
00:00:19,416 --> 00:00:19,750
Hold on.

9
00:00:22,875 --> 00:00:26,208
One warning. If you get fooled and pick the wrong man,

10
00:00:27,916 --> 00:00:31,583
and House Carter falls.

11
00:00:31,583 --> 00:00:34,000
That blood is on your hands.

12
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,916
Hah… So you’re saying
if we don’t choose you,

13
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:42,625
the whole family will collapse?

14
00:00:43,708 --> 00:00:44,250
Perhaps.

15
00:00:44,791 --> 00:00:49,541
You, a miner, think you
can bring down our family?

16
00:00:50,916 --> 00:00:51,750
Ladies and gentlemen,

17
00:00:53,041 --> 00:00:56,208
raise your glasses to our great king of the mines.

18
00:00:58,500 --> 00:00:59,250
Let’s vote.

19
00:01:01,041 --> 00:01:02,500
Hands up for Severin.

20
00:01:14,250 --> 00:01:16,666
One, two, three.

21
00:01:18,375 --> 00:01:20,875
Votes for Severin Carter… zero.

22
00:01:22,541 --> 00:01:22,750
Perfect!

23
00:01:23,875 --> 00:01:26,125
Truly the eldest
son of House Carter!

24
00:01:33,291 --> 00:01:35,875
All those in favor of Redmond
Carter as heir,

25
00:01:35,875 --> 00:01:37,458
raise your hands.

26
00:01:37,916 --> 00:01:39,416
For lord Redmond.

27
00:01:40,208 --> 00:01:42,250
The elders stand with Redmond.

28
00:01:42,791 --> 00:01:43,583
The house cast.

29
00:01:43,583 --> 00:01:44,416
The rightful.

30
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:45,416
No more delays.

31
00:01:46,250 --> 00:01:46,625
Lord Redmond.

32
00:01:46,666 --> 00:01:47,708
The decision is clear.

33
00:01:47,833 --> 00:01:48,791
Long live house cast...

34
00:01:48,791 --> 00:01:49,750
Oh.

35
00:01:56,916 --> 00:01:58,458
I, Redmond,

36
00:01:59,250 --> 00:02:01,916
swear on my life that I will never betray your trust.

37
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:06,291
I will lead House Carter to greatness!

38
00:02:10,291 --> 00:02:11,250
I now declare

39
00:02:14,166 --> 00:02:16,583
Redmond the
new head of House Carter.

40
00:02:26,083 --> 00:02:29,125
Severin, didn’t you claim that if we didn’t choose you,

41
00:02:29,166 --> 00:02:30,916
House Carter would be destroyed?

42
00:02:40,500 --> 00:02:42,291
Well… look at us.

43
00:02:43,166 --> 00:02:44,166
We’re all just fine.

44
00:02:57,750 --> 00:02:58,625
Hear my command.

45
00:02:59,250 --> 00:03:01,583
Target, House Carter in Emeraldstone.

46
00:03:03,708 --> 00:03:06,208
Seize and wipe out every territory,

47
00:03:06,208 --> 00:03:09,208
every asset, as fast as possible.
